-   * @throws IllegalArgumentException if <tt>initialCapacity < 0 || (minLoadFactor < 0.0 || minLoadFactor >= 1.0) ||
-   *                                  (maxLoadFactor <= 0.0 || maxLoadFactor >= 1.0) || (minLoadFactor >=
-   *                                  maxLoadFactor)</tt>.
